  {
    "chinese": "一个有良好医德的医生懂得倾听比开处方更有疗效。",
    "english": "A physician with a good bedside manner knows that listening can be more therapeutic than prescribing.",
    "soundmark": "/ə fɪˈzɪʃn wɪð ə ɡʊd ˈbedsaɪd ˈmænə nəʊz ðæt ˈlɪsənɪŋ kən biː mɔː ˌθerəˈpjuːtɪk ðən prɪˈskraɪbɪŋ/",
    "grammar": [
      {
        "text": "A physician with a good bedside manner",
